      "title": "Weak pronouns I: el, la, els, les",
      "goal": "Replace direct objects: el veig, la conec, l'he vist.",
      "note": "Direct-object pronouns go before a conjugated verb: **el veig** (lo veo), **la conec**, **els compro**, **les convido**. Before a vowel or h: **l'he vist**.\n\nNo leísmo: *le vi (a él)* → **el vaig veure**.\n\n*Te quiero* (love) → **T'estimo**. Querer in that sense is **estimar**.\n\nWith a feminine pronoun the participle can agree: **L'he comprada** (also accepted: l'he comprat).",
