    {
      "id": "b1-04",
      "title": "The pronoun en",
      "goal": "Say 'I have two', 'I don't have any', 'there are lots'.",
      "note": "Castellano has no equivalent. **En** replaces an indefinite noun or a quantity:\n\n- *¿Tienes hijos? — Tengo dos.* → **En tinc dos.**\n- *No tengo.* → **No en tinc.**\n- *Hay muchos.* → **N'hi ha molts.**\n\nIt also replaces *de + something*: *Sé mucho de eso* → **En sé molt.**\n\nShapes: **en**, **n'** (before a vowel), **-ne / 'n** after the verb (**compra'n**).",
